    "tolerance_px": 2,
    "touch_minimum": "Explicit project minimum is 44x44px at capture density 1 and remains independent of reference scaling; visual rectangles are compared separately with the existing 2px tolerance. A visible header content union can be smaller than its touch parent and must have its own semantic mapping.",
