    "diff_px": "Maximum absolute x/y/width/height delta among measured mapped geometry entries only; not full-image difference",
    "unmapped": "Every design target element without a mapping is reported unmeasured, never inferred from a parent rectangle",
    "vertical_anchor": "Explicit safe_bottom entries preserve width-scaled design size and distance from the application frame bottom; only y is anchored to the verified Android safe content bottom. Other entries retain their existing coordinate rules.",
    "painted_size": "Explicit text leaves compare original-pixel ink width/height using identical dark/muted/red foreground masks on source and capture, all three profile pairs, valid capture basis and measured clip containment. Text line-box/source-region deltas remain diagnostic only; tolerance stays 2px."
